stdin	-
argv	batch=8192 count=20000 elimit=3 plimit=2 climit=3
why	the workhorse run (Lon 2026-10-02: "This is the ULTIMATE test of SCRIPtix."): the generator's full walks (twenty thousand random EXPR and MATCH expressions from seed 1, every EXPR expression of at most 3 tokens, every calculator-subject match S ? P with P at most 2 tokens and S at most 3, about 396,000 lines) in batches of 8192, each batch EVALed by SCRIP and answered by a SPITBOL child through a !command pipe, run ONCE at wall clock; the sample (no arguments) is the generator's own sample, 1,833 expressions in batches of 1024
